<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="496902074"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537241312"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Magia"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kalafina"/><amll:meta key="album" value="「魔法少女まどか☆マギカ」 Ultimate Best"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:08.779"><div begin="00:18.857" end="04:48.344"><p begin="00:18.857" end="00:24.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">いつか君が瞳に灯す愛の光が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾经于眼眸中点亮的爱之光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ki mi ga hi to mi ni to mo su a i no hi ka ri ga</span></p><p begin="00:24.823" end="00:26.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">時を超えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越了时空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki wo ko e te</span></p><p begin="00:26.270" end="00:29.987" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">滅び急ぐ世界の夢を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">急剧毁灭的世界之梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ro bi i so gu se ka i no yu me wo</span></p><p begin="00:30.454" end="00:33.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">確かに一つ 壊すだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">确实又一个面临终结</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta shi ka ni hi to tsu ko wa su da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:34.603" end="00:36.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">躊躇いを飲み干して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吞噬所有踌躇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra i wo no mi ho shi te</span></p><p begin="00:37.253" end="00:40.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">君が望むモノは何?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你有何所求</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga no zo mu mo no wa na ni ?</span></p><p begin="00:40.571" end="00:45.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">こんな欲深い憧れの行方に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此贪婪的憧憬尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na yo ku bu ka i a ko ga re no yu ku e ni</span></p><p begin="00:45.818" end="00:49.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">儚い 明日はあるの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会有虚渺的明日么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ka na i a shi ta wa a ru no ?</span></p><p begin="00:51.377" end="00:54.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">子供の頃 夢に見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同孩提时梦见的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo no ko ro yu me ni mi te ta</span></p><p begin="00:55.028" end="00:58.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">古の魔法のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">古老魔法那般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ni shi e no ma ho u no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:58.995" end="01:02.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">闇さえ砕く力で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用粉碎黑暗的力量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya mi sa e ku da ku chi ka ra de</span></p><p begin="01:02.807" end="01:06.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">微笑む君に 会いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去与微笑的你相逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho e mu ki mi ni a i ta i</span></p><p begin="01:06.771" end="01:09.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">怯えるこの手の中には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这颤抖不止的手中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bi e ru ko no te no na ka ni wa</span></p><p begin="01:10.384" end="01:13.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">手折られた花の勇気<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">握着被摘下的花之勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta o ra re ta ha na no yu u ki</span></p><p begin="01:14.285" end="01:17.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">想いだけが頼る全て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独思念可依靠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da ke ga ta yo ru su be te</span></p><p begin="01:18.136" end="01:24.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">光を呼び覚ます 願い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是唤醒光明的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri wo yo bi sa ma su</span></p><p begin="01:31.280" end="01:34.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">いつか君も誰かの為に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你终究会为了某人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ki mi mo da re ka no ta me ni</span></p><p begin="01:35.331" end="01:38.658" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">強い力を 望むのだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而渴求强大力量吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo i chi ka ra wo no zo mu no da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:39.115" end="01:42.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">愛が胸を捉えた夜に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心被爱所困的夜里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ga mu ne wo to ra e ta yo ru ni</span></p><p begin="01:42.462" end="01:46.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">未知の言葉が 生まれて来る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未知的言词便会从此萌生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi no ko to ba ga u ma re te ku ru</span></p><p begin="01:46.538" end="01:48.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">迷わずに行けるなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若不再犹豫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo wa zu ni yu ke ru na ra</span></p><p begin="01:49.540" end="01:52.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">心が砕けてもいいわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕心碎也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ga ku da ke te mo i i wa</span></p><p begin="01:53.053" end="01:56.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">いつも目の前の哀しみに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那句尚能与眼前的悲哀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo me no ma e no ka na shi mi ni</span></p><p begin="01:57.241" end="02:01.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">立ち向かう為の 呪文が欲しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">作斗争的咒语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta chi mu ka u ta me no</span></p><p begin="02:04.375" end="02:07.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">君はまだ夢見る記憶<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是沉沦梦中的记忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wa ma da yu me mi ru ki o ku</span></p><p begin="02:08.188" end="02:11.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">私は眠らない明日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是难以安眠的明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa ne mu ra na i a shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:12.201" end="02:15.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">二人が出会う奇跡を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了将两人相遇的奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri ga de a u ki se ki wo</span></p><p begin="02:16.127" end="02:19.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">勝ち取る為に進むわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">争取到手而勇往直前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka chi to ru ta me ni su su mu wa</span></p><p begin="02:19.817" end="02:23.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">怯えるこの手の中には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这颤抖不止的手中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bi e ru ko no te no na ka ni wa</span></p><p begin="02:23.666" end="02:26.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">手折られた花の刃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残着被摘下的花之刃纹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta o ra re ta ha na no ya i ba</span></p><p begin="02:27.568" end="02:30.843" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">想いだけが生きる全て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独思念是活着的证明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da ke ga i ki ru su be te</span></p><p begin="02:31.018" end="02:41.734" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">心に振りかざす 願い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是挥舞心中的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ni fu ri ka za su</span></p><p begin="03:36.187" end="03:40.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">囚われた太陽の輝く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被囚禁的太阳的光辉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ra wa re ta ta i yo u no ka ga ya ku</span></p><p begin="03:43.829" end="03:48.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">不思議の国の本が好きだった頃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢看奇异之国的书的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu shi gi no ku ni no ho n ga su ki da 't ta ko ro</span></p><p begin="03:51.771" end="03:54.449" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">願いはきっと叶うと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿望必定会实现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i wa ki 't to ka na u to</span></p><p begin="03:55.512" end="03:57.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">教えるお伽噺(とぎばなし)を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此教导的童话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o shi e ru o to gi ba na shi wo</span></p><p begin="03:57.883" end="04:05.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">信じた (光と影の中)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深信不疑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji ta</span></p><p begin="04:14.725" end="04:18.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">静かに咲き乱れていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">静谧的绽放于世</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu ka ni sa ki mi da re te i ta</span></p><p begin="04:18.802" end="04:22.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">古の魔法優しく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">古老魔法温柔地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ni shi e no ma ho u ya sa shi ku</span></p><p begin="04:22.299" end="04:25.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">世界を変える力が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘟哝着改变世界的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wo ka e ru chi ka ra ga</span></p><p begin="04:26.544" end="04:29.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">その手にあると囁く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">力量就在你双手中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no te ni a ru to sa sa ya ku</span></p><p begin="04:30.447" end="04:33.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">終わらない夢を見よう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈入永无止境的梦乡吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ra na i yu me wo mi yo u</span></p><p begin="04:34.251" end="04:37.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">君と行く時の中で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在与你同行的时光中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to yu ku to ki no na ka de</span></p><p begin="04:38.101" end="04:41.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">想いだけが生きる全て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独思念是活着的证明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i da ke ga i ki ru su be te</span></p><p begin="04:42.068" end="04:48.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">命を作るのは 願い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">创造生命的是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi wo tsu ku ru no wa</span></p></div></body></tt>